g is a breathing style  centered around the properties of fire  and flames this breeding style uses  movements and techniques that are  inspired by the behavior of flames and  this style is centered around swift and  powerful strikes of the sword flame  breathing users have produced a hashida  in every single generation since the  style first emerged so the position of  flame hashida has a long and highly  respected history water breathing is the  only other style that shares this honor  so it is safe to say that historically  flame breathing has one of the most  important and most powerful breathing  styles but what is flame breathing and  how did it come into existence in the  first place it was actually the former  flame hashira shinjuru rengoku who  revealed to tanjiro that every single  breathing style originated from a single  style called sun breathing or breath of  the sun sun breathing was the first  breathing style and it was created by  the legendary demon slayer yorichi  tsugikuni a man who lived about 400  years before the beginning of the demon  slayer story thanks to his ability to  use sun breathing yorichi is the man who  came the closest to killing muzon and he  was the only person muzon feared but  because yorichi didn't finish muzon off  the demons continued to exist and they  continued to pose a threat to the  innocent people of japan yorichi knew  that this demon threat would persist  even after his death so he decided to  teach other demon slayers to use the  breath of the sun in order to keep up  the fight against muzon and his demons  unfortunately yorichi's students were  not able to fully grasp the power of sun  breathing so yurichi had to adjust the  breath of the sun to fit the abilities  of his students one of these students  became the first user of flame breathing  flame breathing is essentially a less  powerful offshoot of sun breathing and  this breeding style was passed on from  generation to generation for over four  centuries until it was inherited by the  current members of the rengoku family  but the story of flame breathing does  not end there just as flame breathing  itself was derived from sun breathing  once that original breathing style was  modified to suit the needs of yorichi  student mitsuri kandra ji's love  breathing style is derived from flame  breathing that kyoji orengoku had taught  her love breathing is a style unique to  mitsuri and it is an alteration of flame  breathing designed to take advantage of  her unusual physique and especially her  unique muscle density and so flame  breathing is not only a derivative of  sun breathing but it itself can also be  the foundation of other derivative  styles like love breathing flame  breathing has nine unique forms but only  six of them are known at this time  these include first form unknowing fire  an attack that involves the user  charging their opponent and swinging  their blade with the attempt to  decapitate the enemy second form rising  scorching sun which is an upward slash  attack third form blazing universe which  is an arched upward slash fourth form  blooming flame undulation which involves  the user spinning their sword rapidly in  order to defend from enemy attacks fifth  form flame tiger which involves multiple  sword slashes that form the shape of a  tiger and finally ninth form rengoku a  fiery slash from a distance that has the  power to obliterate everything in sight  this ninth form is said to be unique to  the members of the rengoku family  personally i would love to know more  about the first flame breathing user and  how flame breathing came to be a staple  of the rengoku family in particular but  unfortunately the absolute mad lad  shinjuru rengoku the father of kyojiro  destroyed the generational flame hashia  record of the rengoku family it is  important to note that kyojiro's father  shinjuro is a former flame hashira  himself and he was once extremely  dedicated and successful in his role as  a demon slayer in episode 1 of the  second season of the demon slayer anime  we meet an elderly woman who works as a  bento box vendor at a railway station we  eventually learned that 20 years before  the mugen train arc this same elderly  woman and her daughter were saved from a  demon by shinjuro and back then he  seemed to have been just as impressive  as his son kyojiro is today so much so  that the woman at first mistakes kyojiro  for his father but shinjuro was deeply  affected by the premature death of his  wife ruka and after this happened he  started drinking too much and he  eventually no longer wanted to be a  hashida he retired and he actively  discouraged both of his sons from  joining the demon slayer core however  his discouragement although mean and  brutal actually came from a good place  shinjuru knew how dangerous the life of  a demon slayer was and he wanted his  sons to stay away from that danger but  instead of being honest with them he  tried to bully and intimidate them into  following the path that he had chosen  for them and that plan failed miserably  since we know that kyojiro eventually  became the new flame hashira if you want  to know more about the life of kyoto in  particular i already made an entire 20  minute video talking about him and his  backstory i will link it in the  description and in the pinned comment  and that is everything that we know  about flame breathing in demon slayer  again if you want to see me make a  similar video on the other breathing  styles leave a like and also comment  which breathing style you want me to do  next 10 000 likes at 1 000 comments  unlocks the next video don't forget that  here at anime opera we have a huge and  growing demon slayer video playlist and  more videos are coming soon so  definitely subscribe hit that bell and  then select the option that says all you  can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at animeopror oh and one more  time don't forget to check out our  partner itaikuji use the p